ed neighbour by neighbour in ascending order; an entry moves above an equal parent and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sinks to the left child unless the right one is strictly greater. O((n + m) log n).","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"}}}